File Index: 90 of 109
Audio ID: 7214005112551853327
Audio Duration: 11m 6.9s (666.93s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 13:20:17 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 当你觉得自己很牛逼的时候
Segment #2   [00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,780] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 只能说明你的圈儿太小了
Segment #3   [00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,060] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 20 | Text: 那怎么破圈儿去选择更有意义的朋友去拓展人脉呢
Segment #4   [00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,820] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果你伸出底层去不干平反
Segment #5   [00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,520] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 你一定要内心的看完这个视频
Segment #6   [00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,960] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 看完你要觉得没用
Segment #7   [00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,060] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 你可以随时拉黑掉我
Segment #8   [00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,560] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 一个人想要从底层杀上来
Segment #9   [00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,780] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 他的核心本质就是提高情商
Segment #10  [00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,960] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 做局 交朋友
Segment #11  [00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,420] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 11 | Text: 有一句话其实说的特别有道理
Segment #12  [00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,820] | Elapsed:  12.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 你身边朋友的平均财富
Segment #13  [00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,940] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是你的财富
Segment #14  [00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,980] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 举个例子 你作为五个朋友
Segment #15  [00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,540] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 12 | Text: 这五个朋友平均生压十万块钱
Segment #16  [00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,840] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 你的生压有可能只有五万
Segment #17  [00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,420] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 称天都不会超过十万
Segment #18  [00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,460] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 这是千古不变的定律
Segment #19  [00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,700] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为开奔驰的
Segment #20  [00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,440] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 不会跟几公交车的人在一起玩
Segment #21  [00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,300] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是他们曾经也是你现在这样
Segment #22  [00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,380] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 只不过说
Segment #23  [00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,040] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 14 | Text: 他们更加懂得向上社交的底层逻辑
Segment #24  [00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:52,720] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 13 | Text: 谁的奔驰也不是从天上掉下来的
Segment #25  [00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,660] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 会做人才能成事
Segment #26  [00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:55,900] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 时代再变
Segment #27  [00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,540] | Elapsed:  27.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是向上社交的底层逻辑
Segment #28  [00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,320] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 8  | Text: 几千年来就没有变故
Segment #29  [00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,060] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 11 | Text: 向上社交就请记住一句话
Segment #30  [00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:03,320] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 永远都不要去怕
Segment #31  [00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:05,560] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 比自己牛逼的人社交而焦虑
Segment #32  [00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,680] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 也永远不要总觉得
Segment #33  [00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,260] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 别人会不会去惦记你什么
Segment #34  [00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:10,640] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 11 | Text: 哎呀 他怎么这么有钱还跟我玩啊
Segment #35  [00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,760] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 他是不是拖什么
Segment #36  [00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,580] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 哎呀 他怎么这么有钱
Segment #37  [00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:15,060] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 还要喊着我一起做生意啊
Segment #38  [00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:15,940] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 他是不是要骗我
Segment #39  [00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:19,000] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 12 | Text: 现在很多人都有这种被迫害妄想的
Segment #40  [00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,540] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 8  | Text: 总想着 哎 不行 不行
Segment #41  [00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:22,920] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 这些东西不行 不行
Segment #42  [00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,340] | Elapsed:  44.77s | Words: 10 | Text: 兄弟说吧 你有啥好骗的
Segment #43  [00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:27,060] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 光脚的怕什么穿鞋的
Segment #44  [00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,340] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #45  [00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,640] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 但有些人就会有这种
Segment #46  [00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,080] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 社交恐惧症
Segment #47  [00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,440] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 道理其实也很简单
Segment #48  [00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,440] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁跟比自己相处
Segment #49  [00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,200] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是比自己强的人相处
Segment #50  [00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,200] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁都会有压力
Segment #51  [00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,820] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 你仔细地研究一下
Segment #52  [00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:39,540] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 你会发现
Segment #53  [00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:41,160] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 这不是理性逻辑
Segment #54  [00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,160] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是动物病的
Segment #55  [00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,400] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们举个例子
Segment #56  [00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,620] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 把一只小猫
Segment #57  [00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,840] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 和一只狮子
Segment #58  [00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,020] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 关在同间房间里
Segment #59  [00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,420] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 狮子可能刚吃完饭
Segment #60  [00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,260] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 12 | Text: 都没想去吃这只可爱的小猫
Segment #61  [00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:51,940] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 1  | Text: 但是
Segment #62  [00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:54,180] | Elapsed:  62.05s | Words: 12 | Text: 这个小猫也会被吓得胆人心情
Segment #63  [00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:56,060] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 这就是动物世界的本能
Segment #64  [00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:57,260] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #65  [00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:58,980] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 只要这个小猫没活过
Segment #66  [00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:00,340] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 它必然会对狮子
Segment #67  [00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,440] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 有本能的恐惧
Segment #68  [00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,180] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 好在是动物界的本能
Segment #69  [00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:04,220] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 咱们回到人间
Segment #70  [00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:07,180] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 比方说你和马鱼
Segment #71  [00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:08,660] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 马花糖坐在一个房间里
Segment #72  [00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:10,120] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们把全部生鸭
Segment #73  [00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,440] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 摆在桌子上
Segment #74  [00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,040] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 你也拿出你的全部生鸭
Segment #75  [00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,500] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 好 微信支付宝
Segment #76  [00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,240] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 加你的钢笼
Segment #77  [00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,480] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 8  | Text: 加起来一百二十五
Segment #78  [00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,040] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 你心想说好
Segment #79  [00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:18,880] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 2  | Text: 你好富
Segment #80  [00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:19,480] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 2  | Text: 你好穷
Segment #81  [00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:21,000] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 你是大哥 我是地中地
Segment #82  [00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,140] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 有必要吗
Segment #83  [00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:23,180] | Elapsed:  78.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 根本没必要
Segment #84  [00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:25,180] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们确实比你强
Segment #85  [00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,040] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 他们有财富
Segment #86  [00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:27,760] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 有资源
Segment #87  [00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,500] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 2  | Text: 有人卖
Segment #88  [00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:30,320] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 有格局
Segment #89  [00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,780] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 各方面都比你优秀
Segment #90  [00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,640] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是这一切都只不过说
Segment #91  [00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,880] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 是人类社会富裕
Segment #92  [00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,180] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们的社会属性
Segment #93  [00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:37,920] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 而并非按照动物界
Segment #94  [00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,160] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 来说的天然属性
Segment #95  [00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,080] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 这也就意味着
Segment #96  [00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,940] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 按照人类文明社会的
Segment #97  [00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:42,580] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 生存法则
Segment #98  [00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:43,540] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 他们充气量
Segment #99  [00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:44,820] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 最多最多
Segment #100 [00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:46,100] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 也就是无事意
Segment #101 [00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,800] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 而不会去剥夺你什么
Segment #102 [00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,320] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 你也不是那个小猫
Segment #103 [00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:50,180] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 他们也不是
Segment #104 [00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:51,500] | Elapsed:  95.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个老虎式的大象
Segment #105 [00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:52,860] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的肉身
Segment #106 [00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:53,860] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 也并非是他们
Segment #107 [00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:55,280] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 9  | Text: 四肌而动的价值所在
Segment #108 [00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,480] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们更不会因为说
Segment #109 [00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,280] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 我很有钱了
Segment #110 [00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,440] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 10 | Text: 我去把你那一百二十五
Segment #111 [00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:00,600] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 抢过来
Segment #112 [00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,020] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #113 [00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,480] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为他们已经比你好
Segment #114 [00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,520] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 太多太多了
Segment #115 [00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,020] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 再说了
Segment #116 [00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:05,120] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 就马总那个小铁壳
Segment #117 [00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,400] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 你在一高边腿上学
Segment #118 [00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,060] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 他能给得住
Segment #119 [00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,200] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以你记住了
Segment #120 [00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,100] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果说
Segment #121 [00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:11,820] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们身处的
Segment #122 [00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:13,060] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是动物世界
Segment #123 [00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,360] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 而是人间
Segment #124 [00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,100] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 在人间
Segment #125 [00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:17,240] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 就要有人间的选举
Segment #126 [00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,240] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 比你强的人
Segment #127 [00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,740] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 对你最大的伤害
Segment #128 [00:03:19,740 --> 00:03:20,560] | Elapsed: 111.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是不屌你
Segment #129 [00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,120] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #130 [00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,080] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是无视你
Segment #131 [00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,740] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 你没有任何可以失去的
Segment #132 [00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:25,020] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以你有什么可怕的
Segment #133 [00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:26,680] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 面对强者
Segment #134 [00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,980] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 首先你要做到
Segment #135 [00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,120] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 不悲不抗
Segment #136 [00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,440] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 这不是底线了
Segment #137 [00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,200] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 而是套路
Segment #138 [00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,160] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 3  | Text: 你越怕
Segment #139 [00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:33,760] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 3  | Text: 越不敢
Segment #140 [00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,740] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 越没有机会
Segment #141 [00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:36,300] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 1  | Text: 如果
Segment #142 [00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:37,200] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个道理
Segment #143 [00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,160] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 你这个道理
Segment #144 [00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:38,920] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 你都想不通
Segment #145 [00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,360] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 你再回想一下
Segment #146 [00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,040] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是我们平时和那些
Segment #147 [00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:44,180] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 不如我们的朋友
Segment #148 [00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,120] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 在交往的时候
Segment #149 [00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,380] | Elapsed: 125.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们也没有去会
Segment #150 [00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,620] | Elapsed: 125.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 去想着去
Segment #151 [00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:48,840] | Elapsed: 125.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 惦记别人的东西
Segment #152 [00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,700] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #153 [00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,320] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 把你自己换成那种
Segment #154 [00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:51,960] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 比你强的
Segment #155 [00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,180] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 把你下游的朋友
Segment #156 [00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:54,160] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 换成你自己
Segment #157 [00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,020] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个东西
Segment #158 [00:03:55,020 --> 00:03:55,860] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 是不是就很好的
Segment #159 [00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:56,580] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 可以理解了
Segment #160 [00:03:56,580 --> 00:03:57,760] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 你是不是就是
Segment #161 [00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,020] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 在能理解比你
Segment #162 [00:03:59,020 --> 00:03:59,580] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 高端的人
Segment #163 [00:03:59,580 --> 00:04:00,680] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 在和你社交的时候
Segment #164 [00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,940] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 6  | Text: 也会像你一样
Segment #165 [00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:02,520] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 诚恳的
Segment #166 [00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:03,540] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 1  | Text: 好
Segment #167 [00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:03,980] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果说
Segment #168 [00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:04,940] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们想明白这一点
Segment #169 [00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:05,640] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 我们就再
Segment #170 [00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:07,300] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 9  | Text: 更深一步的去思考一下
Segment #171 [00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,300] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 你仔细的想一想
Segment #172 [00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,980] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 你在跟你自己
Segment #173 [00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:13,160] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 下游的朋友
Segment #174 [00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,200] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 3  | Text: 交往的时候
Segment #175 [00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,400] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 4  | Text: 你得到了什么
Segment #176 [00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,220] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 7  | Text: 是不是得到了精神上的
Segment #177 [00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:17,540] | Elapsed: 141.77s | Words: 2  | Text: 放松
Segment #178 [00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,420] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 情绪价值
Segment #179 [00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:19,020] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 对吧
Segment #180 [00:04:19,540 --> 00:04:19,920] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 因此
Segment #181 [00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,720] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说有比你高端的朋友
Segment #182 [00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,620] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 也愿意和你交朋友的时候
Segment #183 [00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:24,820] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们得到的也是
Segment #184 [00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:26,180] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 同样就在这个地方
Segment #185 [00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,380] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 情绪价值
Segment #186 [00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:28,340] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 这也就意味着
Segment #187 [00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:30,160] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 人们在向下社交的时候
Segment #188 [00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:31,500] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 下游人士
Segment #189 [00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:32,660] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 提供的更多的
Segment #190 [00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:33,940] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 并非是物质价值
Segment #191 [00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,540] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 更多的是情绪价值
Segment #192 [00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:37,520] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为你比他拥有的多
Segment #193 [00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,640] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 他不值得你惦记
Segment #194 [00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,220] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #195 [00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:40,780] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们获得的是
Segment #196 [00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:43,640] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 精神领域的情绪价值
Segment #197 [00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,560] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 这也就是
Segment #198 [00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,760] | Elapsed: 158.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 向下持交的全部
Segment #199 [00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,580] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 因此如果说
Segment #200 [00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:49,260] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 你希望你去和这种
Segment #201 [00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:51,560] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 比你更加优秀的人相处
Segment #202 [00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,040] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 想和他们出好关系
Segment #203 [00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,580] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 那他们的情绪价值
Segment #204 [00:04:54,580 --> 00:04:55,240] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是接近
Segment #205 [00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,860] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 这也就是情商的来源
Segment #206 [00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:58,760] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 委屈自己成全别人
Segment #207 [00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:01,280] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 教他们你觉得
Segment #208 [00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,940] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 你所做的一切
Segment #209 [00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:03,960] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 都是为他好
Segment #210 [00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,100] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 这是忠诚思维
Segment #211 [00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:06,780] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 教他们觉得你有趣
Segment #212 [00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:08,540] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 这是大致弱欲的思维
Segment #213 [00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:09,480] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 教他们觉得
Segment #214 [00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,920] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 你可以绝对信任
Segment #215 [00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,620] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 3  | Text: 肯帮他
Segment #216 [00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,300] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 不帮别人
Segment #217 [00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:13,140] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 帮亲不帮你
Segment #218 [00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,920] | Elapsed: 174.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 这是顾名大臣的思维
Segment #219 [00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,940] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 你们看看啊
Segment #220 [00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:18,160] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是社会上
Segment #221 [00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,900] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 善于走高层路线的人
Segment #222 [00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:20,420] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 2  | Text: 或者说
Segment #223 [00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:21,740] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 能够凭借的
Segment #224 [00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:22,440] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 从底层
Segment #225 [00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,560] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 凭借的情商
Segment #226 [00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,460] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 爬到高处的人
Segment #227 [00:05:24,460 --> 00:05:25,720] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 是不是没拖开这几类
Segment #228 [00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,480] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 这也就是
Segment #229 [00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,800] | Elapsed: 190.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 情商值钱之处
Segment #230 [00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,540] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 你也可以看情商
Segment #231 [00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:32,380] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 所有的情商
Segment #232 [00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:33,720] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 本质上就是一种
Segment #233 [00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,720] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 面向上层的智慧
Segment #234 [00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:37,300] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 这层说完了
Segment #235 [00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:38,140] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要是不赞同
Segment #236 [00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:39,720] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 你也就不要往下看了
Segment #237 [00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,240] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 我怕你再
Segment #238 [00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,500] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 我怕把你切了
Segment #239 [00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:42,460] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 你在评论区骂我
Segment #240 [00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,680] | Elapsed: 190.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 如果认同
Segment #241 [00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,380] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 那你点个赞
Segment #242 [00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:46,380] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 咱们再向下深挖一层
Segment #243 [00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:48,660] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 3  | Text: 其实我们可以
Segment #244 [00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,440] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 仔细的想一下
Segment #245 [00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:50,820] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 3  | Text: 本质上
Segment #246 [00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:53,420] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 向下社交和向上社交
Segment #247 [00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:54,920] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 哪一个更值得人信赖
Segment #248 [00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:56,780] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 答案可能会失望
Segment #249 [00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:58,980] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 答案是向上社交
Segment #250 [00:05:58,980 --> 00:06:00,860] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 更加值得我们信赖
Segment #251 [00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:02,300] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说你是一个中产
Segment #252 [00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:03,880] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 你喝一群下人社交
Segment #253 [00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,600] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们什么都给不了你
Segment #254 [00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,960] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们只能给你提供
Segment #255 [00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,400] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 2  | Text: 所有的
Segment #256 [00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,640] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 刚才我说的情绪价值
Segment #257 [00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,340] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 还夸你牛逼
Segment #258 [00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:10,520] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 你好棒 逗你好帅
Segment #259 [00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,620] | Elapsed: 206.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 你长得好漂亮
Segment #260 [00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,460] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 人在赞美别人的同时
Segment #261 [00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,560] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 付出的是什么
Segment #262 [00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,400] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 也需要付出
Segment #263 [00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,520] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 付出的是什么东西
Segment #264 [00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,620] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 是我不如你的这一份尊严
Segment #265 [00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,260] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 而社交的本质就是价值交换
Segment #266 [00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:24,900] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 那么你拥有的比我多
Segment #267 [00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,700] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 你支付了尊严
Segment #268 [00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:27,700] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 我支付了什么
Segment #269 [00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,700] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 支付了市场
Segment #270 [00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:29,840] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 从我这儿得到的东西
Segment #271 [00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:30,520] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的资源
Segment #272 [00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,080] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的人卖
Segment #273 [00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:31,760] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的财富
Segment #274 [00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,940] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 总之哪有人会白白付出
Segment #275 [00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:34,300] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #276 [00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,620] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 所以向下
Segment #277 [00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:37,980] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 向下兼容的社交
Segment #278 [00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:39,100] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 你得到了舒服
Segment #279 [00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:39,740] | Elapsed: 222.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 付出的
Segment #280 [00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:40,780] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 确实真心白意
Segment #281 [00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,720] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 我从来没有段时间
Segment #282 [00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,620] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 赚了点钱
Segment #283 [00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:44,860] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后我就开始漂了
Segment #284 [00:06:44,860 --> 00:06:46,260] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 结交了一群小伙伴
Segment #285 [00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,980] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 也算是向下社交了
Segment #286 [00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:49,040] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 请他们吃饭
Segment #287 [00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,640] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 跟他们讲道理
Segment #288 [00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,880] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 跟他们聊一些东西
Segment #289 [00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:54,440] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后还给他们讲故事
Segment #290 [00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,240] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 一开始他们也都对我
Segment #291 [00:06:57,220 --> 00:06:58,320] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 都毕竟毕竟
Segment #292 [00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:59,460] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是后来
Segment #293 [00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:01,700] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 大家的认知也越来越同频了
Segment #294 [00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,600] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 3  | Text: 他们也开始
Segment #295 [00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,620] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 做了一些自己的事
Segment #296 [00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:05,440] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 也赚到钱了
Segment #297 [00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,340] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 个别人就开始漂了
Segment #298 [00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:09,000] | Elapsed: 237.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 这就是向下结交的
Segment #299 [00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,740] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 一种结果
Segment #300 [00:07:09,740 --> 00:07:11,340] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 你是高 他是低
Segment #301 [00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:12,900] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 水往低处流
Segment #302 [00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:14,120] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 5  | Text: 人往高处走
Segment #303 [00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,100] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #304 [00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,280] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 6  | Text: 有的时候一旦吃平
Segment #305 [00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,000] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 你会发现
Segment #306 [00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,060] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 6  | Text: 小水坑里的水
Segment #307 [00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:19,640] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 最终也流向大海了
Segment #308 [00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:24,780] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 3  | Text: 人就这样
Segment #309 [00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:26,340] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 他得到了他想要的
Segment #310 [00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:28,080] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 6  | Text: 就必然不会支付
Segment #311 [00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,920] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 9  | Text: 他对你所支付的东西
Segment #312 [00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,620] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 这是千古不变的定律
Segment #313 [00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:32,500] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是人性
Segment #314 [00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:33,500] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 4  | Text: 向下社交
Segment #315 [00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:35,180] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 特别特别考验人性
Segment #316 [00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:38,120] | Elapsed: 251.88s | Words: 10 | Text: 有些人确实会心疼感恩
Segment #317 [00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:38,820] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 但有些人
Segment #318 [00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:40,420] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 过河才晓 吃力爬位
Segment #319 [00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:42,160] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 而向上社交
Segment #320 [00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,200] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 则就不同了
Segment #321 [00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,900] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果对方不认可你
Segment #322 [00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,580] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 根本就不会给你的机会
Segment #323 [00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,740] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 不会跟你社交
Segment #324 [00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:49,460] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 7  | Text: 对方既然认可你
Segment #325 [00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:51,500] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 以高位 结交低位的你
Segment #326 [00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:53,200] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 这必然是觉得你有闪光点
Segment #327 [00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,700] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 而这个闪光点
Segment #328 [00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:56,240] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 8  | Text: 必然不是你能给他什么
Segment #329 [00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,000] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #330 [00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,160] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 你什么都给不了他
Segment #331 [00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,560] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 而是你的人性
Segment #332 [00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,640] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 6  | Text: 你做人的本质
Segment #333 [00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:01,340] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的善良
Segment #334 [00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:01,900] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的真诚
Segment #335 [00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:02,640] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的实在
Segment #336 [00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,020] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 等等等等一切
Segment #337 [00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:04,840] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 某些事物
Segment #338 [00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:05,520] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 打动了他
Segment #339 [00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,580] | Elapsed: 268.95s | Words: 9  | Text: 只要你保持新鲜不变
Segment #340 [00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:09,400] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 保证不会从这些人身上
Segment #341 [00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,300] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 得到点东西之后
Segment #342 [00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:11,240] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 就翻脸不认人
Segment #343 [00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,680] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 那么这个社交关系
Segment #344 [00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,940] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 就会保持很长久
Segment #345 [00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:14,980] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 1  | Text: 所以呢
Segment #346 [00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,440] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 发现道理
Segment #347 [00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,140] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个道理吧
Segment #348 [00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:18,500] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 你作为下位
Segment #349 [00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,520] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 和上位结交
Segment #350 [00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,340] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 主动权在你
Segment #351 [00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,740] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 你作为上位和下位结交
Segment #352 [00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:25,840] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 主动权反而在别人手里
Segment #353 [00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,920] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 那么主动权
Segment #354 [00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,020] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 在自己手里的关系
Segment #355 [00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:29,500] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 是不是更加值得信赖呢
Segment #356 [00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:31,300] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 那个让自然非礼电影
Segment #357 [00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:32,440] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 江文有一句台词
Segment #358 [00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,660] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 我想站着
Segment #359 [00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:34,920] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 把钱挣了
Segment #360 [00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,620] | Elapsed: 285.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 这恰恰就是向上社交
Segment #361 [00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:38,260] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 和向下社交的姿态
Segment #362 [00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:39,960] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 向下结交
Segment #363 [00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,520] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 向下社交
Segment #364 [00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,240] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 你得到的是
Segment #365 [00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:42,900] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 你能站着
Segment #366 [00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,040] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 下边的人把你当盐
Segment #367 [00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:44,940] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 你获得的尊严
Segment #368 [00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,400] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 而向上社交
Segment #369 [00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,220] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 你得跪着
Segment #370 [00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:49,040] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是你能把钱挣到了
Segment #371 [00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,720] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 2  | Text: 上面的人
Segment #372 [00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,980] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 但凡心理认可你
Segment #373 [00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:51,920] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要做点事
Segment #374 [00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,140] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 都会去帮助你
Segment #375 [00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:54,420] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是记住
Segment #376 [00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:55,760] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 别人给你的尊严
Segment #377 [00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,080] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 是时刻会说回去的
Segment #378 [00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,800] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是别人给你的实惠
Segment #379 [00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,320] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 7  | Text: 无论是财富 资源
Segment #380 [00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,060] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 3  | Text: 还是认知
Segment #381 [00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:02,160] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 一旦给了
Segment #382 [00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,580] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是永远是你的了
Segment #383 [00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:04,720] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 5  | Text: 哪个更牢固
Segment #384 [00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,740] | Elapsed: 303.13s | Words: 6  | Text: 你自己琢磨琢磨
Segment #385 [00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:08,080] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 我说了这么多
Segment #386 [00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,380] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是想说明一个道理
Segment #387 [00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:11,100] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 永远别畏惧
Segment #388 [00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:12,940] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 比自己强的人接触
Segment #389 [00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:14,700] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们要是真的看不起你
Segment #390 [00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:15,880] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 最多就是不屌你
Segment #391 [00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:16,860] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 但如果说
Segment #392 [00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:18,200] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们愿意拿你当朋友
Segment #393 [00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,760] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 可能稍微你低低头
Segment #394 [00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,980] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是你获得了
Segment #395 [00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:21,900] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 变强的机会
Segment #396 [00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,720] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 郭仁韩旭老师
Segment #397 [00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,080] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 9  | Text: 见了好几个立马横刀
Segment #398 [00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,620] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是想跑
Segment #399 [00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,920] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是想跑就是欣然
Segment #400 [00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,300] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 事实上大可不必
Segment #401 [00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:31,480] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 你要向于
Segment #402 [00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,180] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 你得勇敢地向强者
Segment #403 [00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:34,220] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 表达自己的价值
Segment #404 [00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:34,960] | Elapsed: 319.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 结交他们
Segment #405 [00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,560] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 8  | Text: 在自己有了价值之后
Segment #406 [00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,540] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 再用方法
Segment #407 [00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:38,880] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 再用分享的方式
Segment #408 [00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,700] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 回馈强者
Segment #409 [00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:41,620] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 8  | Text: 这才是人间正道的
Segment #410 [00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:42,840] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 老话说得好
Segment #411 [00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,480] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 宁做鸡头
Segment #412 [00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,660] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 不做风尾
Segment #413 [00:09:45,660 --> 00:09:46,740] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 事实上
Segment #414 [00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:47,360] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 2  | Text: 鸡头
Segment #415 [00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,340] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 永远是鸡的一部分
Segment #416 [00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,100] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 不但要抚养
Segment #417 [00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,420] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 不但要负担起
Segment #418 [00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:56,460] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 9  | Text: 给鸡体工营养的重任
Segment #419 [00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:57,860] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 而且在杀鸡的时候
Segment #420 [00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:58,780] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 先是变着头
Segment #421 [00:09:58,780 --> 00:09:59,380] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 咔嚓一下
Segment #422 [00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,000] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 而风尾则不然
Segment #423 [00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,880] | Elapsed: 335.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 凤凰也是需要尾巴的
Segment #424 [00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,340] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有尾巴的凤凰
Segment #425 [00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:05,500] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 跟安存有什么区别
Segment #426 [00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:07,280] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 你要是做了风尾
Segment #427 [00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,500] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 高低也是一个水鸟
Segment #428 [00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:09,040] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #429 [00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,880] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 多好比做一只安存鸡
Segment #430 [00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:12,440] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 1  | Text: 所以呢
Segment #431 [00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,320] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 不要觉得向上社交
Segment #432 [00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,580] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 是攀附权贵
Segment #433 [00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,660] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 还是区言富士
Segment #434 [00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:17,840] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 这种说法
Segment #435 [00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,760] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 完全是别有用心的人
Segment #436 [00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,160] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 担心太多普通人
Segment #437 [00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,080] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 介事成功
Segment #438 [00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,080] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 而写的错误理论
Segment #439 [00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,720] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 人往高处走
Segment #440 [00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,300] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 才是天道所去
Segment #441 [00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:30,020] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 借着厉害的朋友
Segment #442 [00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:30,880] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 爬到高处
Segment #443 [00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:31,860] | Elapsed: 351.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 再拿朋友一把
Segment #444 [00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:32,720] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 和恶之友
Segment #445 [00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,280] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 把自己留放到弱者的弱者
Segment #446 [00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,240] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 权力去当强者
Segment #447 [00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,980] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 他本质上
Segment #448 [00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,020] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 这就是懦夫行为
Segment #449 [00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:39,460] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 和强者为伍
Segment #450 [00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:40,680] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 这才是自强之道
Segment #451 [00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,420] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 少年勇士
Segment #452 [00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:44,020] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 总是一枚心思土龙
Segment #453 [00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:44,720] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 3  | Text: 殊不知
Segment #454 [00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:48,480] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 未必每条龙都是恶龙
Segment #455 [00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,640] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 也许有的龙
Segment #456 [00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,240] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 3  | Text: 说不定
Segment #457 [00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,400] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 愿意给你败巴胸
Segment #458 [00:10:52,260 --> 00:10:53,240] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 欲龙之术
Segment #459 [00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,240] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 比土龙之术可好多了
Segment #460 [00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,780] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 如果你能见我言
Segment #461 [00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,460] | Elapsed: 367.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 自见本我
Segment #462 [00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,680] | Elapsed: 373.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 附近这一弄
Segment #463 [00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,500] | Elapsed: 373.58s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个故事
Segment #464 [00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:02,980] | Elapsed: 373.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 咱们就算没白脚
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
